data: {"id": "9ec63bc72b824449-thinking-parallel_evidence-1415", "run_id": "9ec63bc72b824449", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 事实总结\n\n### ✅ Kubernetes 资源状态（直接证据）\n1. **Pod 状态**: `ContainerCreating` / `Pending`，已持续 **31分钟**。\n2. **根因事件**: \n   - `FailedMount`: `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（出现23次，持续31分钟）\n   - `FailedMount`: `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]`（出现10次，持续29分钟）\n3. **容器**: 名为 `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 -c \"import time; time.sleep(3600)\"`，**未启动**，无 Container ID。\n4. **UID**: `e798824d-dd3f-4414-bcc1-fa96560da3f1`（身份一致，无复用）。\n5. ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788417837791, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

